    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1878" root="بخر" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَخَرٌ</span></b>  <i>Stench,</i> or <i>fetor, of the mouth</i> [or <i>breath</i>]
(S, A, K) <i>&amp;c.:</i> (AHn, K:) and <i>any odour that
rises and diffuses itself,</i> (K, TA,) <i>whether stinking
or not;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُخَارٌ</span></b> . (TA.)

